    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Issues by reason",
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "timescaledb"
      },
      "description": "LATE: dropped, behind the watermark. TIME_SKEW (> SKEW_REPORT_S) and PRICE_JUMP (> PRICE_JUMP_REPORT between closes): kept, reported. Zero prices (316,382 daily reset records) are dropped and only counted in the Flink log, not stored here. See architecture \u00a73.8.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "timescaledb"
          },
          "rawSql": "SELECT reason AS \"Reason\", count(*) AS \"Events\", count(DISTINCT symbol) AS \"Symbols\", min(event_time) AS \"First\", max(event_time) AS \"Last\" FROM data_issue WHERE $__timeFilter(event_time) GROUP BY reason ORDER BY 2 DESC",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byType",
              "options": "time"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "time:YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Reasons** (architecture \u00a73.8)\n\n| Reason | Handling |\n|---|---|\n| `LATE` | dropped: event time behind the watermark (60 s bound) |\n| `TIME_SKEW` | kept: trading time far from the system time |\n| `PRICE_JUMP` | kept: close moved > 10 % from the previous close |\n| `ZERO_PRICE` | dropped, counted in the log only |\n| `MALFORMED`, `NEGATIVE_PRICE`, `IMPLAUSIBLE_TIME`, `TRADING_DATE_MISMATCH`, `WINDOW_OUT_OF_ORDER` | none in the dataset |\n\nTimes are local exchange time (CET) shown as UTC, as stored (architecture \u00a73.3). The default range is the trading week of the dataset, 8\u201312 Nov 2021."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Issues per hour (event time)",
      "id": 12,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
